    "text": "In this repository, `config` refers to file-backed service values, `settings` refers to UI preferences, and `options` refers to request-scoped overrides.\n\nTo apply the retry policy, call `ApplyRetryPolicy` with API field `retryPolicy.maxAttempts`. Open the [retry documentation](https://docs.example.com/retries?v=3) and select **Advanced Settings**. The configuration file path is `/etc/acme/app.yaml`.\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nacmectl config set retry_count 3 --file /etc/acme/app.yaml\n```\n\nUse this code without modification:\n\n```ts\nconst retry = ApplyRetryPolicy(config, options);\n```\n\nPreserve these diagnostics:\n\n- Error: `invalid value for \"retry_count\"`\n- Log: `level=warn component=retry request_id=7f3a`\n- Test: `--- FAIL: TestApplyRetryPolicy (0.04s)`",
